  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="2b70f056-d51e-53f4-9065-f096c1686fa9" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Resolve verified tenant identity through a cell-routing catalogue; quotas, movement and isolation need code.&#10;Resolve requested organization scope against verified active membership; never trust a body orgId or role.&#10;Expected-version mutations and attributable history apply within the organization; only admins manage membership/settings.&#10;Include orgId in data/index/idempotency/background/cache scope, allowing colliding local IDs in two organizations.&#10;SUSPENDED organizations deny all member business operations; platform operators have health-only access.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
